with Pitney Bowes.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:41.000
This is one example of how
Apigee and Orbitera can

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:46.530
help enable ISV
multi-cloud distribution.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:49.978
In the top, you see Orbitera.

00:21:49.978 --> 00:21:52.745
The visible portion
to your end users

00:21:52.745 --> 00:21:55.830
is that white-label
e-commerce store.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.170
But it's powered by
our billing management

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.240
engine, customer
management tools that

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:04.900
allow for customer-specific
pricing, or even

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:07.520
account-specific pricing.

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:11.450
We can enable test drives
on multiple cloud platforms,

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:13.160
and integrate with
multiple catalogs

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:16.260
across those different clouds.

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:23.450
Apigee, meanwhile, helps
provide that unified layer

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:26.630
that allows for a
single call into Apigee

00:22:26.630 --> 00:22:30.330
to speak to many
underlying systems.

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:36.770
So here, as an example, we can
help Apigee unify payments,

00:22:36.770 --> 00:22:40.490
ERP, accounting,
and orchestration.

00:22:40.490 --> 00:22:44.990
Apigee secures it, scales it,
and provides a unified API

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:45.590
front.

00:22:45.590 --> 00:22:48.470
Orbitera can then consume
consumption information

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:54.800
from Apigee, and send
orchestration calls, purchase

00:22:54.800 --> 00:23:02.390
calls, credit calls, into
the ISV's underlying systems.

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:07.370
Another potential use case is
to create an app ecosystem.

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:09.970
So because Orbitera
interfaces with multiple cloud

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:12.820
environments and can
orchestrate through,

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:17.660
essentially, an
arbitrary API call,

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:21.360
we can enable an
ecosystem like this,

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:23.160
where the applications
are driven off

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:26.950
of an Orbitera-powered
marketplace.

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:31.180
Billing, catalog management,
as well as partner management,

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:35.110
by the way, and
customer management,

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:39.790
is tooled through the
back-end of Orbitera.

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:43.010
And it allows the store to
surface either first party

00:23:43.010 --> 00:23:47.530
apps, third party apps,
or bundled solutions that

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.000
call into multiple of these.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:54.220
And then, the Apigee Edge API
management platform, again,

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:57.320
helps us interface with all
of those myriad internal ISV

00:23:57.320 --> 00:23:57.820
system.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:09.690
So now we'll go into the actual
