This requires a lot of
work on the Android team

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:41.300
on the device side of things,
Orbitera in the marketplace app

00:24:41.300 --> 00:24:44.720
management and partner
management side of things,

00:24:44.720 --> 00:24:48.110
and then Apigee, making sure
that all these systems--

00:24:48.110 --> 00:24:50.600
both third and first party--

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.390
speak to one another in
a seamless, scalable way.

00:24:55.390 --> 00:24:58.180
Specifically, we're
collaborating to create

00:24:58.180 --> 00:25:05.140
