helps modernize and streamline

00:25:05.140 --> 00:25:07.810
the Pitney Bowes
shipping label machine,

00:25:07.810 --> 00:25:10.750
and turns it into just a
shipping label machine--

00:25:10.750 --> 00:25:14.380
or a strong, market-leading
shipping label machine,

00:25:14.380 --> 00:25:15.550
I should say--

00:25:15.550 --> 00:25:19.110
to a digital
distribution platform,

00:25:19.110 --> 00:25:23.970
where they can not only fulfill
their goal of making shipping

00:25:23.970 --> 00:25:27.800
easy, but also use it as
a monetization platform

00:25:27.800 --> 00:25:30.080
for future distribution.

00:25:30.080 --> 00:25:32.566
So if you look at
this diagram, I

00:25:32.566 --> 00:25:33.940
want to first draw
your attention

00:25:33.940 --> 00:25:39.660
to the right-hand side, the
