00:25:39.660 --> 00:25:43.056
Apigee provides this
unified management layer,

00:25:43.056 --> 00:25:44.430
where they have
a billing account

00:25:44.430 --> 00:25:47.310
API, payment transaction
API, different kinds

00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:50.370
of reconciliation
reporting APIs,

00:25:50.370 --> 00:25:56.050
that Orbitera can call into
