app marketplace,

00:26:00.750 --> 00:26:05.840
we can integrate with Apigee,
with Pitney Bowes' systems,

00:26:05.840 --> 00:26:08.960
to instantly validate whether
they can purchase this or not,

00:26:08.960 --> 00:26:11.050
checking their ledger account.

00:26:11.050 --> 00:26:13.790
We'll create that
transaction in the ERP system

00:26:13.790 --> 00:26:16.520
