00:26:17.840 --> 00:26:21.880
All on the click of Buy.

00:26:21.880 --> 00:26:26.430
Orbitera, in the
middle, helps talk

00:26:26.430 --> 00:26:29.970
to the Android-powered
device as well as Apigee,

00:26:29.970 --> 00:26:35.210
and provides a partner portal,
through which Pitney Bowes'

00:26:35.210 --> 00:26:38.060
